  "ruleText": "Env-A 610.03 Definition. For the purpose of this part, the following definition shall apply:\n\n(a) “Emergency generator” means “emergency generator” as defined in Env-A 103.\n\nSource. #8129, eff 7-28-04; amd by #9119-B, eff 4-3-08; ss by #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
